Subject: [PATCH] ramboot: pass optional reset TTL into the kernel environment

Forward a numeric REDOX_RAMBOOT_TTL supplied to the UEFI build into the
kernel environment so the RAM shell can schedule its opt-in reset.

Agent: Codex
Host: 3090
